cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol, code or data, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "Continuation-Based Causal Testing of Chain-of-Thought (load-bearing-cot)"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and release artifacts for continuation-based causal
  testing: an ablation-patch intervention that perturbs one reasoning step,
  truncates the chain, and forces the model to continue, measuring how tightly
  a written chain-of-thought constrains the answer it precedes.
version: "load-bearing-v0.1"
